timeline: 1
# The story of the Marvel Cinematic Universe as it happens inside the films and series, in story order.
# Only what happens in the story world: no release dates, castings or studio news.
# Time runs left to right but the dates mean nothing: each box is as long as its label needs.
# Boxes are placed so that as few connections as possible cross, an event with a single connection sits right beside the event it connects to (before it when that event comes later, after it when it came earlier), and as many connections as possible run from the right end of one box to the left end of the next. Every event has at least one connection. Rows only stack boxes.
# A connection leads from an event to one that follows from it: a cause, or the next step of the same character's story.
